                            &lt;div class="ug-feature-purpose" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Configure platform-wide settings — Feature Visibility, platform/runtime configuration, diagnostics, Runtime Diagnostics, developer-only ReviewContext Validation, and maintenance.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
                        &lt;button class="ug-expand-btn" aria-expanded="false" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;▼&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
