[xUnit.net 00:00:01.36]                                   &lt;div class="ug-feature-purpose" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review cross-system integration quality, target registry coverage, dependency risk, and integration readiness.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.36]                               &lt;button class="ug-expand-btn" aria-expanded="false" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;▼&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-feature-card ug-fcard-analysis " b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-feature-header" blazor:onclick="19" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-analysis" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analysis&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
