[xUnit.net 00:00:01.78]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Starting any QA session, sprint review, or executive status check.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-review" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
