[xUnit.net 00:00:01.78]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Upload and review a spec.md file; extract and classify candidates. Analysis results include Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage, Flow View, and Spec Explorer.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
