Field lines (with ** and :): 9&#xD;
  - **Language/Version**: C# 13 / .NET 10...&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.80]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;A go/no-go assessment across three delivery gates: Ready for Development, Ready for Testing, and Ready for Release. Each gate produces a pass/fail verdict with blockers. Available as a pack in Quality Review.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;QA Score&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
  - **Primary Dependencies**: ASP.NET Core Minimal API, EF Core 10, Azure.Messaging....&#xD;
  - **Storage**: SQL Server 2022 - shared `AutorisasjonsDbContext`; new `KjentBruker...&#xD;
  - **Testing**: xUnit 2.9.3, Shouldly 4.3.0, NSubstitute 5.x, Testcontainers 4.x...&#xD;
  - **Target Platform**: Container on Azure (same cluster as `Autorisasjon.Api`)...&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.80]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;A scored assessment of quality across five categories: Specification Quality, Plan Quality, Task Readiness, Traceability, and Compliance. Produced by the QA Readiness pack in Quality Review.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.80]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.80]           &lt;section id="ecosystem" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analysis Ecosystem&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.80]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;How the Analysis features relate to each other and to the full SDD governance workflow.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.80]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.80]               &lt;div class="ug-ecosystem-layout" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-ecosystem-main" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h4 class="ug-ecosystem-subtitle" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;SDD Governance Chain&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
