[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]           &lt;section id="overview" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;QA Review Studio is a quality engineering platform focused on &lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Driven Development (SDD)&lt;/strong&gt; — connecting governance rules, requirements, implementation plans, and tasks in a single traceable, governable workflow that spans the full delivery lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;div class="ug-cap-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-icon" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;\ud83d\udccb&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Driven Development&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Use the specification as the single source of truth for requirements, tasks, and tests.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-icon" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;⚖️&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Define, review, and verify governance rules across all SDD artifacts using the project constitution.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-icon" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;\ud83d\udd17&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Maintain a complete chain from governance rules through requirements, plans, and tasks to test execution.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-icon" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;\ud83d\udcca&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Coverage Analysis&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Identify what is tested, what is not, and where gaps exist across the full artifact chain.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-icon" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;⚡&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Impact Analysis&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Estimate regression scope and identify high-risk changes before they reach production.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-icon" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;\ud83d\udd0d&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Deterministic Audit&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Run rule-based quality audits that surface findings, risks, and gaps with no AI involvement.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-icon" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;\ud83e\udd16&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI-Assisted Quality Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Optional AI Change Review for AI-generated implementation changes. Disabled by default and enabled from System Settings → Feature Visibility.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Who uses it?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;div class="ug-audience-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-role" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Tester&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-audience-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Use Specification Review, Traceability, and Quality Review to plan and execute test coverage.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-role" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Test Lead&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-audience-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Orchestrate the full SDD governance workflow, track compliance, and sign off on Quality Review readiness gates.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-role" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Scrum Master&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-audience-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Monitor delivery quality, spot scope changes in Spec Drift, and track QA health on the Dashboard.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-role" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Product Owner&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-audience-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review spec alignment, verify requirements are covered, and use Quality Review to assess go/no-go readiness.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-role" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Developer&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-audience-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Validate implementation plans against the spec using Plan Explorer and Implementation Review before writing code.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-role" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Architect&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-audience-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Use Constitution Explorer, Artifact Traceability, and Impact Analysis to govern architecture across the delivery chain.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]           &lt;section id="concepts" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Core Concepts&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Understanding the four artifact types and the analysis categories that operate across them.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifacts&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;QA Review Studio governs quality across four distinct artifact types. Each artifact is a structured markdown document loaded into the platform for analysis.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;div class="ug-concept-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-file ug-fd-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;constitution.md&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Governance rules, policies, quality standards, and principles. Defines what all other artifacts must comply with.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Primary feature: &lt;a href="/constitution-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution Explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-file ug-fd-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;spec.md&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Functional requirements, user stories, acceptance criteria, and success criteria. The source of truth for what the system must do.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Primary feature: &lt;a href="/extract" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Plan&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-file ug-fd-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;plan.md&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation plan — architecture decisions (ADRs), implementation phases, quality gates, risks, and dependencies.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Primary feature: &lt;a href="/plan-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Plan Explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Tasks&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-file ug-fd-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;tasks.md&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation task list — specific work items referencing functional requirements and organized by sprint or phase.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Primary feature: &lt;a href="/task-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Task Explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analysis&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Four analysis categories work across the artifact set. Each category answers a distinct governance question.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;div class="ug-concept-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-question" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Are artifacts connected?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Measures how well the four artifacts reference each other. Covers Constitution → Spec, Spec → Plan, and Plan → Tasks chains.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature: &lt;a href="/artifact-traceability" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifact Traceability&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Compliance&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-question" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Are artifacts compliant?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Verifies that all artifacts collectively satisfy the governance rules defined in the constitution. Produces a rule-by-rule compliance verdict.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature: &lt;a href="/quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Readiness&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-question" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Can we proceed?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Objective go/no-go assessment across three delivery gates: Development, Testing, and Release. Aggregates all analysis results.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature: &lt;a href="/quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Auditing&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-question" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;What is missing?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Deterministic, rule-based quality audit that finds specific gaps, violations, and risks across all artifacts — no AI involved.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature: &lt;a href="/quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Review&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Review features augment the deterministic analysis layer with AI-powered advisors. AI Review is disabled by default for new installations and development environments. Admins can enable it from &lt;a href="/admin/system-settings" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;System Settings&lt;/a&gt; → &lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature Visibility&lt;/strong&gt; by turning on &lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Change Review&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;div class="ug-concept-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Change Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-question" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Are AI-generated changes aligned to the spec?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI-assisted review of implementation changes for alignment, quality, and risk. Use after AI generates or modifies implementation work.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature: &lt;a href="/ai-change-auditor" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Change Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                   &lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-question" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Does the artifact set meet the quality bar?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Run multiple deterministic review packs simultaneously — compliance, audit, standards, and readiness checks — in a single unified run. Select any combination of packs for each review session.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature: &lt;a href="/quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]           &lt;section id="features" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Full Feature Matrix&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Every feature at a glance — what it does, what it takes, what it produces, and when to reach for it.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]               &lt;div class="ug-table-scroll" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;table class="ug-table" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;thead b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Section&lt;/th&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                               &lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature&lt;/th&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                               &lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Purpose&lt;/th&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                               &lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Input&lt;/th&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                               &lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Output&lt;/th&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                               &lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When To Use&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                       &lt;tbody b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-review" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/dashboard" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Dashboard&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;SDD Governance Dashboard — overall project health, KPI scores, and recent activity at a glance.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;No input — aggregates data across all analyses&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Governance Score, Traceability %, Compliance %, QA Score, Delivery status, Performance, Project Health, Analysis Summary, Recent Activity&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Starting any QA session, sprint review, or executive status check.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-review" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/constitution-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution Explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review governance rules, policies, standards, and principles from the project constitution.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;constitution.md&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Rule catalog, rule types, governance overview&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Before reviewing specifications and plans — the constitution defines the governance rules everything else must comply with.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-review" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/extract" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Upload and review a spec.md file; extract and classify candidates. Analysis results include Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage, Flow View, and Spec Explorer.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;spec.md&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Extracted requirements, tests, and clarifications; Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage, Flow View, and Spec Explorer&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When starting work on a new feature or reviewing an updated spec.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-review" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/data-model-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Data Model Explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review data-model.md artifacts — entities, tables, columns, relationships, constraints, indexes, and traceability in one place.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;data-model.md&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Entity/table inventory, relationships, indexes, constraints, traceability links, schema findings&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When reviewing or validating a data model before or during implementation. Use when a feature changes database structure or introduces new persistent data.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-review" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/plan-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Plan Explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review implementation plans: architecture decisions (ADRs), phases, quality gates, risks, and dependencies.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;plan.md&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Architecture decisions, implementation phases, quality gates, risks, dependencies&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.83]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When reviewing or validating an implementation plan before or during development.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-review" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
