[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]               &lt;div class="ug-callout ug-callout-tip" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature Visibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Sidebar menu visibility is controlled from &lt;a href="/admin/system-settings" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;System Settings&lt;/a&gt; → &lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature Visibility&lt;/strong&gt;. Disabled modules keep their implementation, routes, and components intact, but they are hidden from the main menu until an admin enables them.&#xD;
