[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                               &lt;span class="ug-faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;▼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-faq-item " b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;button class="ug-faq-q" blazor:onclick="28" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Where are Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage, Flow View, and Spec Explorer?&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                               &lt;span class="ug-faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;▼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-faq-item " b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;button class="ug-faq-q" blazor:onclick="29" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;What is the difference between Spec Drift and Implementation Review?&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                               &lt;span class="ug-faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;▼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-faq-item " b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;button class="ug-faq-q" blazor:onclick="30" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Where did Specification Deltas go?&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                               &lt;span class="ug-faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;▼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-faq-item " b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;button class="ug-faq-q" blazor:onclick="31" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;What is the difference between Impact Analysis and Risk &amp;amp; Testing?&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                               &lt;span class="ug-faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;▼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-faq-item " b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;button class="ug-faq-q" blazor:onclick="32" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;What is a Regression Candidate?&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
