[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]           &lt;section id="glossary" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Glossary&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Common terms used throughout QA Review Studio and its documentation.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]               &lt;div class="ug-concept-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifact&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;A structured markdown document loaded into the Studio for analysis. The four SDD artifacts are constitution.md, spec.md, plan.md, and tasks.md.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;The functional requirements document (spec.md) defining what the system must do — requirements, user stories, acceptance criteria, and success criteria.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;The governance document (constitution.md) defining the rules, policies, and quality standards that all other artifacts must comply with.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Plan&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;The implementation plan (plan.md) containing architecture decisions (ADRs), implementation phases, quality gates, risks, and dependencies.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Task&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;A discrete implementation work item from tasks.md, typically referencing a functional requirement and organized by sprint or phase.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;The measurable chain of references connecting governance rules through requirements, plans, and tasks. High traceability means every item can be traced to its origin.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Coverage&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;The percentage of requirements, tests, or governance rules that are addressed by linked artifacts. Low coverage indicates gaps that need remediation.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Compliance&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Whether artifacts satisfy the governance rules defined in the constitution. Quality Review's Constitution Compliance pack performs a rule-by-rule verdict across all four artifacts.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Governance&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;The set of rules, policies, and quality standards enforced across the SDD artifact chain, originating from the project constitution.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Finding&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;A specific quality issue, gap, or violation identified by an analysis module, classified by severity and category.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Recommendation&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;An actionable suggestion generated by an analysis module to address a finding or improve quality.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Severity&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;The impact classification of a finding: Critical (blocks delivery), High (must be resolved before release), Medium (should be resolved), Low (informational).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Confidence&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;The likelihood that an AI-generated finding or suggestion is accurate. Expressed as High, Medium, or Low. Low-confidence findings still warrant review.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Delivery Readiness&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;A go/no-go assessment across three delivery gates: Ready for Development, Ready for Testing, and Ready for Release. Each gate produces a pass/fail verdict with blockers. Available as a pack in Quality Review.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;QA Score&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;A scored assessment of quality across five categories: Specification Quality, Plan Quality, Task Readiness, Traceability, and Compliance. Produced by the QA Readiness pack in Quality Review.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]           &lt;section id="ecosystem" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analysis Ecosystem&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;How the Analysis features relate to each other and to the full SDD governance workflow.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]               &lt;div class="ug-ecosystem-layout" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-ecosystem-main" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h4 class="ug-ecosystem-subtitle" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;SDD Governance Chain&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                       &lt;div class="ug-eco-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-eco-node" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution Explorer&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-eco-conn" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-eco-node" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-eco-conn" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-eco-node" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Plan Explorer&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-eco-conn" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-eco-node" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifact Traceability&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-eco-conn" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-eco-node" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-eco-conn" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-eco-node ug-eco-terminal" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                   &lt;div class="ug-ecosystem-support" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h4 class="ug-ecosystem-subtitle" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Supporting Capabilities&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                       &lt;div class="ug-support-list" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-support-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-support-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Spec Drift&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                               &lt;div class="ug-support-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Detects coverage gaps, orphan tests, and drift as the codebase evolves.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-support-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-support-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Impact Analysis&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                               &lt;div class="ug-support-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Estimates regression scope and identifies high-risk changes across the project.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-support-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-support-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Change Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                               &lt;div class="ug-support-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Reviews AI-generated implementation changes for alignment and quality concerns.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;div class="ug-support-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-support-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Traceability&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                               &lt;div class="ug-support-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Maps Azure DevOps work items to pull requests, commits, and source files — delivery governance evidence chain.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]       &#xD;
