[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]               &lt;div class="ug-about-content" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-about-block" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;p class="ug-about-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;QA Review Studio is a quality engineering platform focused on:&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                       &lt;ul class="ug-about-list" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Driven Development (SDD)&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Governance from Constitution to Implementation&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability from requirement to test&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Deterministic audit and compliance analysis&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Impact Analysis and risk-based testing&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI-Assisted Quality Review&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                   &lt;div class="ug-about-meta" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-about-row" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-about-label" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Initial concept and implementation&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.90]                           &lt;span class="ug-about-value" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Ajay Anand&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
