[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]           &lt;section id="overview" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;QA Review Studio is a quality engineering platform focused on &lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Driven Development (SDD)&lt;/strong&gt; — connecting governance rules, requirements, implementation plans, and tasks in a single traceable, governable workflow that spans the full delivery lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]               &lt;div class="ug-cap-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-icon" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;\ud83d\udccb&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Driven Development&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Use the specification as the single source of truth for requirements, tasks, and tests.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-icon" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;⚖️&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Define, review, and verify governance rules across all SDD artifacts using the project constitution.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-icon" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;\ud83d\udd17&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Maintain a complete chain from governance rules through requirements, plans, and tasks to test execution.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-icon" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;\ud83d\udcca&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Coverage Analysis&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Identify what is tested, what is not, and where gaps exist across the full artifact chain.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-icon" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;⚡&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Impact Analysis&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Estimate regression scope and identify high-risk changes before they reach production.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-icon" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;\ud83d\udd0d&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Deterministic Audit&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Run rule-based quality audits that surface findings, risks, and gaps with no AI involvement.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-cap-icon" aria-hidden="true" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;\ud83e\udd16&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI-Assisted Quality Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-cap-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Optional AI Change Review for AI-generated implementation changes. Disabled by default and enabled from System Settings → Feature Visibility.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Who uses it?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]               &lt;div class="ug-audience-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-role" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Tester&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-audience-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Use Specification Review, Traceability, and Quality Review to plan and execute test coverage.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-role" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Test Lead&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-audience-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Orchestrate the full SDD governance workflow, track compliance, and sign off on Quality Review readiness gates.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-role" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Scrum Master&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-audience-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Monitor delivery quality, spot scope changes in Spec Drift, and track QA health on the Dashboard.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-role" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Product Owner&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-audience-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review spec alignment, verify requirements are covered, and use Quality Review to assess go/no-go readiness.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-role" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Developer&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-audience-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Validate implementation plans against the spec using Plan Explorer and Implementation Review before writing code.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-audience-role" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Architect&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]                           &lt;div class="ug-audience-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Use Constitution Explorer, Artifact Traceability, and Impact Analysis to govern architecture across the delivery chain.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]           &lt;section id="concepts" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Core Concepts&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Understanding the four artifact types and the analysis categories that operate across them.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.92]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifacts&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;QA Review Studio governs quality across four distinct artifact types. Each artifact is a structured markdown document loaded into the platform for analysis.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;div class="ug-concept-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-file ug-fd-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;constitution.md&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Governance rules, policies, quality standards, and principles. Defines what all other artifacts must comply with.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Primary feature: &lt;a href="/constitution-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution Explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-file ug-fd-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;spec.md&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Functional requirements, user stories, acceptance criteria, and success criteria. The source of truth for what the system must do.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Primary feature: &lt;a href="/extract" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Plan&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-file ug-fd-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;plan.md&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation plan — architecture decisions (ADRs), implementation phases, quality gates, risks, and dependencies.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Primary feature: &lt;a href="/plan-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Plan Explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Tasks&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-file ug-fd-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;tasks.md&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation task list — specific work items referencing functional requirements and organized by sprint or phase.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Primary feature: &lt;a href="/task-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Task Explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analysis&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Four analysis categories work across the artifact set. Each category answers a distinct governance question.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;div class="ug-concept-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-question" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Are artifacts connected?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Measures how well the four artifacts reference each other. Covers Constitution → Spec, Spec → Plan, and Plan → Tasks chains.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature: &lt;a href="/artifact-traceability" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifact Traceability&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Compliance&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-question" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Are artifacts compliant?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Verifies that all artifacts collectively satisfy the governance rules defined in the constitution. Produces a rule-by-rule compliance verdict.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature: &lt;a href="/quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Readiness&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-question" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Can we proceed?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Objective go/no-go assessment across three delivery gates: Development, Testing, and Release. Aggregates all analysis results.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature: &lt;a href="/quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Auditing&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-question" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;What is missing?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Deterministic, rule-based quality audit that finds specific gaps, violations, and risks across all artifacts — no AI involved.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature: &lt;a href="/quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Review&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Review features augment the deterministic analysis layer with AI-powered advisors. AI Review is disabled by default for new installations and development environments. Admins can enable it from &lt;a href="/admin/system-settings" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;System Settings&lt;/a&gt; → &lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature Visibility&lt;/strong&gt; by turning on &lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Change Review&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;div class="ug-concept-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Change Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-question" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Are AI-generated changes aligned to the spec?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI-assisted review of implementation changes for alignment, quality, and risk. Use after AI generates or modifies implementation work.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature: &lt;a href="/ai-change-auditor" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Change Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                   &lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-question" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;em b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Does the artifact set meet the quality bar?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Run multiple deterministic review packs simultaneously — compliance, audit, standards, and readiness checks — in a single unified run. Select any combination of packs for each review session.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature: &lt;a href="/quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]           &lt;section id="features" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Full Feature Matrix&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Every feature at a glance — what it does, what it takes, what it produces, and when to reach for it.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;div class="ug-table-scroll" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;table class="ug-table" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;thead b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Section&lt;/th&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                               &lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature&lt;/th&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                               &lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Purpose&lt;/th&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                               &lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Input&lt;/th&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                               &lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Output&lt;/th&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                               &lt;th b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When To Use&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;tbody b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-review" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/dashboard" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Dashboard&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;SDD Governance Dashboard — overall project health, KPI scores, and recent activity at a glance.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;No input — aggregates data across all analyses&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Governance Score, Traceability %, Compliance %, QA Score, Delivery status, Performance, Project Health, Analysis Summary, Recent Activity&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Starting any QA session, sprint review, or executive status check.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-review" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/constitution-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution Explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review governance rules, policies, standards, and principles from the project constitution.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;constitution.md&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Rule catalog, rule types, governance overview&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Before reviewing specifications and plans — the constitution defines the governance rules everything else must comply with.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-review" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/extract" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Upload and review a spec.md file; extract and classify candidates. Analysis results include Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage, Flow View, and Spec Explorer.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;spec.md&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Extracted requirements, tests, and clarifications; Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage, Flow View, and Spec Explorer&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When starting work on a new feature or reviewing an updated spec.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-review" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/data-model-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Data Model Explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review data-model.md artifacts — entities, tables, columns, relationships, constraints, indexes, and traceability in one place.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;data-model.md&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Entity/table inventory, relationships, indexes, constraints, traceability links, schema findings&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When reviewing or validating a data model before or during implementation. Use when a feature changes database structure or introduces new persistent data.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-review" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/plan-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Plan Explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review implementation plans: architecture decisions (ADRs), phases, quality gates, risks, and dependencies.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;plan.md&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Architecture decisions, implementation phases, quality gates, risks, dependencies&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When reviewing or validating an implementation plan before or during development.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-review" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/task-explorer" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Task Explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review implementation coverage from tasks.md: linked requirements, missing implementation work, delivery risk, and task hierarchy.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;tasks.md&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation coverage summary, delivery-risk indicators, task details, and hierarchy&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When you need to confirm whether specification work is implemented and where delivery gaps remain.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-library" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Library&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/scenarios" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;QA Artifact Library&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Store, discover, and reuse curated QA assets — test scenarios, acceptance tests, requirements, and clarifications published from Specification Review.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Published artifacts from Specification Review&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Searchable library of reusable QA assets grouped by type&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When you want to discover, reuse, or curate QA assets across specifications.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-library" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Library&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/sample-projects" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Sample Projects&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Browse M2LB project folders and load supported SDD artifacts into BirkNext reviewers with one click.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;M2LB project folders (configured via SampleProjects:BaseDirectory in appsettings)&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Per-project view of supported artifacts, context-only files, missing expected files, and recommended Studio pages&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When loading a sample or reference project into BirkNext for demonstration, training, or review.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-library" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Library&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/scenarios/new" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Create Test Scenario&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Manually create or refine structured test scenarios.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Manual input&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;A new test scenario added to the library&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When you need to author a test case that is not captured by extraction.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-analysis" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/spec-drift" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Spec Drift&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Detect coverage gaps, orphan tests, and drift indicators. The Changes tab tracks specification comparison history.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;spec.md + implementation evidence&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Drift indicators, orphaned tests, uncovered requirements, comparison history&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Periodically throughout the project to prevent specification drift, or when specifications change.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-analysis" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/impact-analysis" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Impact Analysis&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Estimate the regression impact and risk footprint of a change.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;spec.md + tasks.md&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Impact assessment with affected areas and risk classification&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Before a release or when a significant change is introduced.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-analysis" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/artifact-traceability" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Requirements Traceability&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analyze end-to-end coverage across the Constitution → Specification → Plan → Tasks chain.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;constitution.md + spec.md + plan.md + tasks.md&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Coverage matrix, traceability chains, gap report per artifact layer&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When you need to confirm that requirements are traced through all four artifact layers.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-quality" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Run multiple deterministic review packs simultaneously — select any combination of Quality, Governance, Standards, and Readiness packs for a single unified run.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;constitution.md + spec.md + plan.md + tasks.md (any combination)&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Combined findings dashboard, per-pack score cards, top issues, and detailed results grouped by pack&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When you need a comprehensive quality assessment before a milestone — combine any of the eight available packs in one run.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-analysis" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/task-alignment" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Validate a tasks.md against spec.md for alignment, risk, and test coverage.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;spec.md + tasks.md&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Spec alignment report, risk classification, regression candidates&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Before implementing or reviewing an implementation plan.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-ai" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/ai-change-auditor" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Change Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI-assisted review of implementation changes for alignment, quality, and risk. Disabled by default; enable it from System Settings → Feature Visibility.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI-generated change description or diff&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review findings, risk indicators, alignment assessment&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;After using AI to generate or modify implementation and after an admin has enabled AI Change Review.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-quality" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/frontend-quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Frontend Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Unified frontend review — performance, security, accessibility, standards compliance, Blazor WASM-specific checks, and QA readiness in a single run against your deployed frontend.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Frontend analysis profile (configured in System Settings)&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Overall quality score, domain scores (Performance, Security, Accessibility, Standards, Blazor WASM, Readiness), findings by severity, and prioritised recommendations&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When reviewing a deployed frontend for pre-release quality, security, and performance compliance.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-quality" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/api-quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;API Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review API integration quality, endpoint contracts, authentication expectations, and service-readiness signals.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;API quality target configured for the current review&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;API quality findings, risks, and recommendations&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When reviewing backend/API readiness before integration or release.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-quality" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/integration-quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Integration Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review cross-system integration quality, target registry coverage, dependency risk, and integration readiness.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Integration target registry and current review context&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Integration findings, risk signals, and readiness recommendations&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When a feature depends on external services, APIs, message flows, or deployment integrations.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-analysis" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/implementation-traceability" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Traceability&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Map implementation work items (Azure DevOps) to pull requests, commits, and changed files — producing a deterministic evidence chain for delivery governance.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Azure DevOps work item IDs&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Work Item → Pull Request → Commit → Changed Files traceability chain&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When you need to verify that implementation work is tracked in Azure DevOps and traceable to source code changes.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-traceability" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/traceability" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Legacy session-level coverage view — hidden from the sidebar by default. Specification Review now embeds Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage after analysis.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Extracted analysis from Specification Review&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Coverage percentages, gap indicators, requirement and test counts by category&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When your team has enabled the legacy Traceability section and wants a persistent summary view of current-session coverage results.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-traceability" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/traceability/suggestions" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability Suggestions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Legacy traceability suggestion workflow — hidden from the sidebar by default. Enable it from Feature Visibility only if your team still uses it.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI-generated link suggestions from session analysis&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Pending suggestions with confidence scores; accept or reject each to update coverage&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When legacy Traceability is enabled and coverage is low enough to justify suggested test-to-requirement links.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-traceability" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/code-traceability" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Code Traceability&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Legacy code-to-requirement linking workflow — hidden from the sidebar by default. Enable it from Feature Visibility only if your team still uses code-level traceability.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Source code file registrations via the UI&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;KPIs: tracked files, requirements implemented, tests implemented, files missing traceability links&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When legacy Code Traceability is enabled and you need to verify that source files are linked to requirements and tests.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-admin" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Admin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/admin/system-settings" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;System Settings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Configure platform-wide settings — Feature Visibility, platform/runtime configuration, diagnostics, Runtime Diagnostics, developer-only ReviewContext Validation, and maintenance.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;No input — configuration interface&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Platform configuration across all modules and features&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When configuring the platform for your team or setting up frontend analysis profiles.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]           &lt;section id="workflow" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;SDD Workflow&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;The workflow is dynamic and workspace-aware. The &lt;a href="/getting-started" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Recommended Workflow&lt;/a&gt; page is the reviewer/release workflow: it adapts based on loaded artifacts, explicit manual review, and release approval progress. Developer diagnostics are kept under System Settings -&gt; Developer and do not count as workflow approvals.&lt;/p&gt;
&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;The Recommended Workflow Page&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Visit &lt;a href="/getting-started" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;/getting-started&lt;/a&gt; for a live, interactive guide that:&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;ul class="ug-fd-list" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Shows your workspace&lt;/strong&gt; — project name, artifact count, and readiness badges for Constitution, Specification, Plan, Tasks, and Data Model&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Recommends your next action&lt;/strong&gt; — a "Next Recommended Action" card shows the most valuable step based on what's loaded and what you've completed&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Highlights the current step&lt;/strong&gt; — the workflow step you should focus on is visually emphasized&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Locks unavailable steps&lt;/strong&gt; — steps that require artifacts you haven't loaded yet are marked as "Locked" until their prerequisites are met&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Shows manual approval status&lt;/strong&gt; — artifacts can unlock pages automatically, but only reviewer actions mark steps as reviewed, pending approval, approved, or needing changes&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Excludes developer diagnostics&lt;/strong&gt; — Environment Diagnostics, ReviewContext Validation, Runtime Diagnostics, and Documentation Health stay under System Settings → Developer&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Updates in real-time&lt;/strong&gt; — the workflow refreshes automatically when you load artifacts, run analysis, or toggle features from Feature Visibility&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;h4 class="ug-feature-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Typical Workflow Sequence&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;While the workflow is dynamic, a typical sequence looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]               &lt;div class="ug-core-flow-layout" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-core-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-flow-node ug-flow-secondary" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;1 · Load Artifacts&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-conn" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-node ug-flow-secondary" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;2-5 · Review Supporting Artifacts&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-conn" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-node ug-flow-primary" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;6 · Run Reviews &amp; Analysis&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-conn" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-node ug-flow-primary" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;7 · Quality Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-conn" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-node ug-flow-secondary" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;8 · Optional: AI Change Review or Advanced Analysis&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                   &lt;div class="ug-flow-branches" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h4 class="ug-branches-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature Visibility Control&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-branch-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-branch-badge" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Review&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;span class="ug-branch-when" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Disabled by default. Enable from System Settings → Feature Visibility → AI Review to add AI Change Review to the workflow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-branch-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-branch-badge" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Legacy Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;span class="ug-branch-when" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Hidden by default. Enable from System Settings → Feature Visibility → Traceability Navigation if your team still uses legacy Code Traceability or Traceability Suggestions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                       &lt;div class="ug-branch-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-branch-badge" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Developer Tools&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.93]                           &lt;span class="ug-branch-when" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;System Settings → Developer includes ReviewContext Validation and runtime diagnostics for developer/admin use only. These checks are not release approval steps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;div class="ug-callout ug-callout-tip" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Key insight:&lt;/strong&gt; The Recommended Workflow is not a diagnostics console. It is a release-review guide that evolves with your workspace. Start by loading artifacts, then follow the "Next Recommended Action" card. Use System Settings → Developer for internal consistency checks.
        &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]           &lt;section id="workspace" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Workspace&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Your workspace is the collection of loaded artifacts and analysis results that drive the entire platform. Understanding workspace state is key to using QA Review Studio effectively.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Workspace Status Panel&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Every page that works with artifacts displays a workspace status panel showing:&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;ul class="ug-fd-list" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Current project name&lt;/strong&gt; — which sample project or workspace is active&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifact count&lt;/strong&gt; — how many of the five supported artifacts are loaded (Constitution, Specification, Plan, Tasks, Data Model)&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifact readiness badges&lt;/strong&gt; — a badge for each artifact showing loaded (✓) or missing (○) status with color coding&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Workspace States&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Your workspace can be in three states:&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;div class="ug-concept-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Empty Workspace&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;No artifacts are loaded. The Recommended Workflow shows an empty state and recommends loading a sample project. Most review pages are inaccessible.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                   &lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Partial Workspace&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Some artifacts are loaded, but not all five. The Recommended Workflow adapts to what's available and locks steps that require missing artifacts. Quality Review gracefully skips missing artifact analysis.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                   &lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Full Workspace&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;All five artifacts are loaded. The Recommended Workflow shows all steps as available. Run Quality Review with any combination of packs for a complete analysis.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Loading Artifacts&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Load artifacts using &lt;a href="/sample-projects" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Sample Projects&lt;/a&gt;. This page scans configured project folders, shows which artifacts are supported and which are missing, and loads them into your workspace with one click. Once loaded, artifacts remain in the workspace across all pages until you load a different project.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;div class="ug-callout ug-callout-tip" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Workspace persistence:&lt;/strong&gt; Your loaded artifacts and analysis results persist across all pages and browser sessions until you load a different project. You do not need to re-upload files when switching between analysis features.&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]           &lt;section id="workflows" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Typical Workflows&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Common delivery scenarios and the features that support each one.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;div class="ug-workflow-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Full SDD Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Sample Projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Verify Workspace Banner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Explorer Pages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifact Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Complete end-to-end workflow: load a sample or project workspace, verify the workspace banner, inspect explorer pages, run reviews and analysis, then sign off implementation traceability.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;New Feature Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Plan Explorer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality validation for a new feature — extract requirements, review the plan, run Quality Review with Quality and Readiness packs, then validate task alignment.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Existing Project Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Sample Projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution Explorer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Spec Drift&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Onboard an existing project: load supported artifacts from Sample Projects, extract the spec, review governance rules, identify drift, then run Quality Review with Governance and Readiness packs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Validation&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Flow View&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Spec Explorer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Deep review of a single specification — extract requirements, assess coverage, and explore story readiness.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Validation&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Plan Explorer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Task Explorer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Validate that plans and tasks are correctly aligned to the specification and traceable to code — use the Quality (QA Auditor) and Readiness packs in Quality Review.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Release Readiness Assessment&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Pre-release sign-off — run Quality Review with Governance, Quality, and Readiness packs, validate task alignment, then confirm ADO traceability.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Compliance Check&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution Explorer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Focused governance review — run Quality Review with the Constitution Compliance (Governance) and QA Auditor (Quality) packs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Bug Fix&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Fast-path quality check for a targeted bug fix — review the spec, validate task alignment, then run Quality Review with the QA Readiness (Readiness) pack.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Requirement Change&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Spec Drift&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Impact Analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When a requirement changes — identify drift, assess impact, validate task alignment, then re-run Quality Review.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Generated Change&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Change Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;After AI generates implementation: enable AI Change Review from Feature Visibility, review alignment, validate tasks against the spec, then run Quality Review with Quality and Readiness packs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Developer Validation&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;System Settings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;ReviewContext Validation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Export JSON/HTML&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Optional maintainer workflow: validate canonical ReviewContext metrics, inspect PASS/WARNING/FAIL findings, and export JSON or HTML diagnostics when investigating runtime inconsistencies.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]           &lt;section id="feature-details" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature Details&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Expand any feature for full details — purpose, inputs, outputs, recommended users, and when to use or avoid it.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]               &lt;div class="ug-feature-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-feature-card ug-fcard-review " b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-feature-header" blazor:onclick="1" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-review" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                                   &lt;div class="ug-feature-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Dashboard&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                                   &lt;div class="ug-feature-purpose" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;SDD Governance Dashboard — overall project health, KPI scores, and recent activity at a glance.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                               &lt;button class="ug-expand-btn" aria-expanded="false" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;▼&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-feature-card ug-fcard-review " b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-feature-header" blazor:onclick="2" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-review" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:01.94]                                   &lt;div class="ug-feature-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution Explorer&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
