[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When reviewing backend/API readiness before integration or release.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-quality" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/integration-quality-review" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Integration Quality Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Review cross-system integration quality, target registry coverage, dependency risk, and integration readiness.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Integration target registry and current review context&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Integration findings, risk signals, and readiness recommendations&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When a feature depends on external services, APIs, message flows, or deployment integrations.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-analysis" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/implementation-traceability" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Traceability&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Map implementation work items (Azure DevOps) to pull requests, commits, and changed files — producing a deterministic evidence chain for delivery governance.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Azure DevOps work item IDs&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Work Item → Pull Request → Commit → Changed Files traceability chain&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When you need to verify that implementation work is tracked in Azure DevOps and traceable to source code changes.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-traceability" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/traceability" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Legacy session-level coverage view — hidden from the sidebar by default. Specification Review now embeds Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage after analysis.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Extracted analysis from Specification Review&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Coverage percentages, gap indicators, requirement and test counts by category&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When your team has enabled the legacy Traceability section and wants a persistent summary view of current-session coverage results.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-traceability" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/traceability/suggestions" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability Suggestions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Legacy traceability suggestion workflow — hidden from the sidebar by default. Enable it from Feature Visibility only if your team still uses it.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI-generated link suggestions from session analysis&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Pending suggestions with confidence scores; accept or reject each to update coverage&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When legacy Traceability is enabled and coverage is low enough to justify suggested test-to-requirement links.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-traceability" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/code-traceability" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Code Traceability&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Legacy code-to-requirement linking workflow — hidden from the sidebar by default. Enable it from Feature Visibility only if your team still uses code-level traceability.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Source code file registrations via the UI&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;KPIs: tracked files, requirements implemented, tests implemented, files missing traceability links&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When legacy Code Traceability is enabled and you need to verify that source files are linked to requirements and tests.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-area-badge ug-area-admin" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Admin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-feature" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;a href="/admin/system-settings" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;System Settings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Configure platform-wide settings — Feature Visibility, platform/runtime configuration, diagnostics, Runtime Diagnostics, developer-only ReviewContext Validation, and maintenance.&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td class="ug-td-mono" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;No input — configuration interface&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Platform configuration across all modules and features&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                                   &lt;td b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When configuring the platform for your team or setting up frontend analysis profiles.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]           &lt;section id="workflow" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;SDD Workflow&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;The workflow is dynamic and workspace-aware. The &lt;a href="/getting-started" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Recommended Workflow&lt;/a&gt; page is the reviewer/release workflow: it adapts based on loaded artifacts, explicit manual review, and release approval progress. Developer diagnostics are kept under System Settings -&gt; Developer and do not count as workflow approvals.&lt;/p&gt;
&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;The Recommended Workflow Page&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Visit &lt;a href="/getting-started" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;/getting-started&lt;/a&gt; for a live, interactive guide that:&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;ul class="ug-fd-list" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Shows your workspace&lt;/strong&gt; — project name, artifact count, and readiness badges for Constitution, Specification, Plan, Tasks, and Data Model&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Recommends your next action&lt;/strong&gt; — a "Next Recommended Action" card shows the most valuable step based on what's loaded and what you've completed&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Highlights the current step&lt;/strong&gt; — the workflow step you should focus on is visually emphasized&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Locks unavailable steps&lt;/strong&gt; — steps that require artifacts you haven't loaded yet are marked as "Locked" until their prerequisites are met&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Shows manual approval status&lt;/strong&gt; — artifacts can unlock pages automatically, but only reviewer actions mark steps as reviewed, pending approval, approved, or needing changes&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Excludes developer diagnostics&lt;/strong&gt; — Environment Diagnostics, ReviewContext Validation, Runtime Diagnostics, and Documentation Health stay under System Settings → Developer&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Updates in real-time&lt;/strong&gt; — the workflow refreshes automatically when you load artifacts, run analysis, or toggle features from Feature Visibility&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;h4 class="ug-feature-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Typical Workflow Sequence&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;While the workflow is dynamic, a typical sequence looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;div class="ug-core-flow-layout" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-core-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-flow-node ug-flow-secondary" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;1 · Load Artifacts&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-conn" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-node ug-flow-secondary" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;2-5 · Review Supporting Artifacts&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-conn" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-node ug-flow-primary" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;6 · Run Reviews &amp; Analysis&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-conn" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-node ug-flow-primary" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;7 · Quality Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-conn" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                       &lt;div class="ug-flow-node ug-flow-secondary" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;8 · Optional: AI Change Review or Advanced Analysis&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                   &lt;div class="ug-flow-branches" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h4 class="ug-branches-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Feature Visibility Control&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                       &lt;div class="ug-branch-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-branch-badge" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Review&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                           &lt;span class="ug-branch-when" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Disabled by default. Enable from System Settings → Feature Visibility → AI Review to add AI Change Review to the workflow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                       &lt;div class="ug-branch-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-branch-badge" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Legacy Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                           &lt;span class="ug-branch-when" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Hidden by default. Enable from System Settings → Feature Visibility → Traceability Navigation if your team still uses legacy Code Traceability or Traceability Suggestions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                       &lt;div class="ug-branch-item" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-branch-badge" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Developer Tools&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                           &lt;span class="ug-branch-when" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;System Settings → Developer includes ReviewContext Validation and runtime diagnostics for developer/admin use only. These checks are not release approval steps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;div class="ug-callout ug-callout-tip" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Key insight:&lt;/strong&gt; The Recommended Workflow is not a diagnostics console. It is a release-review guide that evolves with your workspace. Start by loading artifacts, then follow the "Next Recommended Action" card. Use System Settings → Developer for internal consistency checks.
        &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]           &lt;section id="workspace" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Workspace&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Your workspace is the collection of loaded artifacts and analysis results that drive the entire platform. Understanding workspace state is key to using QA Review Studio effectively.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Workspace Status Panel&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Every page that works with artifacts displays a workspace status panel showing:&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;ul class="ug-fd-list" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Current project name&lt;/strong&gt; — which sample project or workspace is active&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifact count&lt;/strong&gt; — how many of the five supported artifacts are loaded (Constitution, Specification, Plan, Tasks, Data Model)&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                   &lt;li b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifact readiness badges&lt;/strong&gt; — a badge for each artifact showing loaded (✓) or missing (○) status with color coding&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Workspace States&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Your workspace can be in three states:&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;div class="ug-concept-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Empty Workspace&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;No artifacts are loaded. The Recommended Workflow shows an empty state and recommends loading a sample project. Most review pages are inaccessible.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                   &lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Partial Workspace&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Some artifacts are loaded, but not all five. The Recommended Workflow adapts to what's available and locks steps that require missing artifacts. Quality Review gracefully skips missing artifact analysis.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                   &lt;div class="ug-concept-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-concept-name" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Full Workspace&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]                       &lt;div class="ug-concept-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;All five artifacts are loaded. The Recommended Workflow shows all steps as available. Run Quality Review with any combination of packs for a complete analysis.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;h3 class="ug-subsection-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Loading Artifacts&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;p b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Load artifacts using &lt;a href="/sample-projects" class="ug-inline-link" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Sample Projects&lt;/a&gt;. This page scans configured project folders, shows which artifacts are supported and which are missing, and loads them into your workspace with one click. Once loaded, artifacts remain in the workspace across all pages until you load a different project.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;div class="ug-callout ug-callout-tip" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;strong b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Workspace persistence:&lt;/strong&gt; Your loaded artifacts and analysis results persist across all pages and browser sessions until you load a different project. You do not need to re-upload files when switching between analysis features.&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]           &lt;section id="workflows" class="ug-section" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;h2 class="ug-section-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Typical Workflows&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]               &lt;p class="ug-section-lead" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Common delivery scenarios and the features that support each one.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.07]       &#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]               &lt;div class="ug-workflow-grid" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Full SDD Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Sample Projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Verify Workspace Banner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Explorer Pages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Artifact Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Complete end-to-end workflow: load a sample or project workspace, verify the workspace banner, inspect explorer pages, run reviews and analysis, then sign off implementation traceability.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;New Feature Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Plan Explorer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality validation for a new feature — extract requirements, review the plan, run Quality Review with Quality and Readiness packs, then validate task alignment.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Existing Project Review&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Sample Projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution Explorer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Spec Drift&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Onboard an existing project: load supported artifacts from Sample Projects, extract the spec, review governance rules, identify drift, then run Quality Review with Governance and Readiness packs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Validation&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Traceability &amp;amp; Coverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Flow View&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Spec Explorer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Deep review of a single specification — extract requirements, assess coverage, and explore story readiness.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Validation&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Plan Explorer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Task Explorer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Validate that plans and tasks are correctly aligned to the specification and traceable to code — use the Quality (QA Auditor) and Readiness packs in Quality Review.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Release Readiness Assessment&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Traceability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Pre-release sign-off — run Quality Review with Governance, Quality, and Readiness packs, validate task alignment, then confirm ADO traceability.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Compliance Check&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Constitution Explorer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Focused governance review — run Quality Review with the Constitution Compliance (Governance) and QA Auditor (Quality) packs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Bug Fix&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Specification Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Fast-path quality check for a targeted bug fix — review the spec, validate task alignment, then run Quality Review with the QA Readiness (Readiness) pack.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Requirement Change&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Spec Drift&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Impact Analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;When a requirement changes — identify drift, assess impact, validate task alignment, then re-run Quality Review.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Generated Change&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;AI Change Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Implementation Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Quality Review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;After AI generates implementation: enable AI Change Review from Feature Visibility, review alignment, validate tasks against the spec, then run Quality Review with Quality and Readiness packs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-card" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;div class="ug-workflow-title" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Developer Validation&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-flow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;System Settings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;ReviewContext Validation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-arrow" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ug-wf-step" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Export JSON/HTML&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
[xUnit.net 00:00:02.08]                           &lt;div class="ug-workflow-desc" b-z0y9qx4pqm&gt;Optional maintainer workflow: validate canonical ReviewContext metrics, inspect PASS/WARNING/FAIL findings, and export JSON or HTML diagnostics when investigating runtime inconsistencies.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&#xD;
